      "content": "7. BUDGETARY PROCESS IN INDIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Budget presented annually by Finance Minister.<br/>• Passed by Parliament.<br/>• Includes Revenue and Capital accounts.<br/>",
      "id": "mcow4zp"
    },
