    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Public Finance includes revenue, expenditure and debt.<br/>• Finance Commission formed under Article 280.<br/>• Internal vs External debt distinction important.<br/>• Revenue expenditure does not create assets.<br/>",
